Z||000001||Steve Normington||06-20-2001||05:56 PM||||GM Performance Parts sells a 60 Deg "Bowtie" engine that is 50# lighter than the iron. But, for the price, you could get a LT1 that is 60# lighter than the 2.8 and much more powerful, too.||||reg||1
